cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use tailcheck, please cite it as below."
title: tailcheck
abstract: >-
  VaR and Expected Shortfall backtests in Python, including an implementation
  (from the papers) of the Bayer-Dimitriadis ES regression backtests, FZ0
  scoring and model confidence
  sets, with Monte Carlo checks of size and power for every test.
type: software
authors:
  - name: tailcheck contributors
repository-code: "https://github.com/h-a-forster/tailcheck"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - value-at-risk
  - expected-shortfall
  - backtesting
  - quantile regression
